{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Therefore</b> — ממשק is like ובן משק ביתי (Genesis 15:2), who does not move from the house. Thus ממשק מקום, a place of permanence, that the חרול shall not move from there. And it is a species of thorn, like כסו פניו חרולים (Job 30:7)." "<b>And a mine of salt</b> — like כי יכרה איש (Proverbs 16:27). Yefet said: it is like כי כמוהו כרות רועים (Zephaniah 2:8), like ויכרו שם עבדי יצחק (Genesis 26:25)." "<b>Shall make them a possessor</b> — from the doubled stems, for the kamatz is chaṭuph, like שורק." "<b>And the remnant of my nation shall possess them</b> — my nation."], :book :zephaniah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zephaniah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zfanya"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:47:21.802948405Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}